---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
bodyClass: home
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <p class="kicker">All-volunteer fire and rescue</p>
    <h1>Saving lives and property on Elder Mountain</h1>
    <p class="lede">We are a 501(c)(3) nonprofit fire department staffed entirely by volunteers from the community, with mutual aid to our neighboring departments.</p>
    <p class="actions"><a class="button" href="/join-us/">Volunteer with us</a> <a class="button ghost" href="/about/">About the department</a></p>
  </div>
  <figure class="hero-photo">
    <img src="/img/photos/engine-1-station.jpg" alt="Engine 1 parked outside the Elder Mountain fire station" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 55vw, 100vw">
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="wrap split">
  <figure class="split-photo">
    <img src="/img/photos/engine-1-pump-panel.jpg" alt="Side of the engine showing the Elder Mountain Fire Rescue shield and the pump panel" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 45vw, 100vw">
  </figure>
  <div>
    <h2>Rapid, all-hazard response</h2>
    <p>We respond to the residents of Elder Mountain, and we back up our neighboring departments through mutual aid agreements.</p>
    <ul class="ticks">
      <li>Structural, vehicle, and wildland fires</li>
      <li>Rescues and vehicle accidents</li>
      <li>Medical emergencies</li>
      <li>Other hazards</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap split reverse">
    <figure class="split-photo">
      <img src="/img/photos/lz-training-group.jpg" alt="Volunteers standing in front of a LifeForce medical helicopter in a field" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 45vw, 100vw">
    </figure>
    <div>
      <h2>Run by your neighbors</h2>
      <p>About 20 volunteers serve as firefighters, emergency medical technicians, medical first responders, and support staff. Every one of them is trained or in training.</p>
      <p>We are always accepting applications for firefighters and support members.</p>
      <p><a class="button light" href="/contact/?topic=join">Apply to volunteer</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap recent">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Training and calls</h2>
    <a href="/photo-gallery/">All photos</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="photo-row">
  {%- for p in gallery %}{% if p.home %}
    <li><a href="/photo-gallery/#{{ p.file | replace('.jpg', '') }}"><img src="/img/photos/{{ p.file }}" alt="{{ p.alt }}" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw"></a></li>
  {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
